(text "E17: six common-source FET rail disconnects; AUX-powered precision OV sensing and all-rail interlock. Source rails and protected outputs are distinct nets." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid eae0e168-d60f-5298-a392-9b339b28f252))
(text "Candidate schematic only. No routed board,complete enclosure fit,manufacturer transient/stability model or physical protection proof." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid f51783d0-7a8f-520a-aadc-a937d871de49))
(text "Any source OV/reference-window fault or POWER_RUN low disables all six drivers. Zero source voltage is allowed during startup; no protected-rail supply dependency." (at 20.32 1160.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 9e05cb2e-0d37-53d8-841c-3a9973ad6ab7))
(text "VSONP grouped pads1=S(physical1..3),2=G(physical4),3=D(physical5..8/EP). Body diodes oppose. Gate/source reference floats with each common node." (at 20.32 1170.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 4fa5de04-d1c7-5145-94ca-d606c108e637))
(text "Si8751 timing maxima use100pF load. Actual FET charge,bulk capacitors,MCAP currents,inrush,leakage,partial-power and fault-energy limits require qualification." (at 20.32 1181.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid a57d50a0-fb58-552f-abd7-228dcd71bb15))
(embedded_fonts no))
